<!--
  BSU Bears athletics sitemap for Element451 / BearBuddy
  Revised August 18, 2026. Every URL below was fetched and confirmed to return
  HTTP 200 with extractable text in <main>. 125 URLs were tested, 0 returned 404.

  THE ONE CHANGE THAT MATTERS
  Intramurals had TWO parallel Leagues pages. The previous sitemap listed the
  stale one.

    OLD (removed): /Campus_Recreation/Intramural_Sports/Leagues_page
                   Returns 200 but holds 65 characters: "Fall 2026 Leagues
                   Coming Soon!" This is why BearBuddy could not state the fall
                   lineup or registration dates. The page was not broken, it
                   was abandoned.

    NEW (added):   /Campus_Recreation/Intramural_Sports/Headlines/LEAGUES_PAGE
                   Returns 200 with 1,542 characters: the complete Fall 2026
                   schedule. Quarter 1 is Flag Football, Dodgeball and Ultimate
                   Frisbee, registration opening Friday August 28 and closing
                   Thursday September 10 at 11:45 PM. Quarter 2 is Indoor
                   Soccer and Volleyball, registration opening Monday October 5
                   and closing Monday October 19. Includes start dates, days,
                   game times, locations and captains' meetings, plus a
                   "REGISTER HERE!" link to the dserec dashboard.

  Removing the stale page matters as much as adding the live one. If both are
  indexed, "Fall 2026 Leagues Coming Soon!" competes with the real schedule.

  CORRECTION TO THE PREVIOUS REVISION'S NOTES
  The July 28 header stated that "Intramural offerings are not published on
  bsubears.com" and that the chatbot "cannot be current on which intramural
  sports are running." Both were accurate for the URL that revision listed, and
  both are now wrong for the site as a whole. The offerings, dates, times and
  locations are all published, in crawlable text, at the Headlines URL above.
  No curated text source is required for the lineup.

  OTHER CHANGES
  1. ADDED Headlines/CHAMPIONS_PAGE alongside the existing Champions_Page. Both
     resolve; the Headlines variant is the one the live nav links.
  2. KEPT General_Information/General_Information_-_Page and did NOT add its
     twin at Headlines/MAIN_PAGE. Both return 200 with near-identical content
     (1,492 vs 1,633 characters). Indexing both would duplicate the staff
     contacts and handbook links for no gain.
  3. VERIFIED all 20 schedule URLs and all 20 roster URLs. Every one returns 200
     with substantial content, so the mixed 2025-26 / 2026-27 schedule years in
     the previous revision are correct as written. Rosters remain 2025-26.
  4. RETAINED the omission of the 20 per-sport /news URLs, for the same
     corpus-dilution reason given in the previous revision.

  KNOWN LIMITS THIS SITEMAP STILL CANNOT FIX
  - Thornburg Fitness Center facility_hours yields 34 characters. The hours live
    in a monthly calendar widget that produces no extractable text. Still true
    as of this revision. Facility hours need a curated text source or the bot
    will keep saying it cannot confirm today's hours. The Thornburg
    General_Information page is fine at 3,310 characters.
  - fitness/GroupEX/Spring_2025 is the live URL and returns 1,001 characters,
    but it is a stale season by name. BSU has not published a current GroupEX
    page. Not fixable here.
  - InsideAthletics/SAAC/24-25 is likewise the current live URL despite the old
    year in the path.
  - Intramural registration lives on an external system that a bsubears.com
    sitemap cannot include:
      https://bridgewater.dserec.com/online/intramurals
    This URL now also appears as a link on the Headlines LEAGUES_PAGE, so a
    crawl of that page should pick it up. Verify after ingesting rather than
    assuming.

    DOMAIN WARNING, UNCHANGED AND STILL LIVE: BearBuddy offered students
    engage.bridgew.edu/ATHLETICS/rsvp as the intramural registration
    destination as recently as today. engage.bridgew.edu is EngageBSU, for
    clubs, groups and campus events. It is never the host for intramural
    registration. This is a URL-construction error, not stale data here, and
    cannot be fixed from this file. The rule belongs in the BearBuddy
    instructions under LINKS / Known domain boundaries.

  - Stale intramural activity names are NOT coming from this site. BearBuddy
    returns "SIGS Dodgeball Tournament", "Competative Basketball" (with that
    misspelling), "Outdoor Soccer" and "REC Basketball", and an unpublished
    phone number, 508-531-2498. None of these strings appear on any
    bsubears.com page checked, and no intramural page publishes a phone number.
    Re-ingesting this sitemap will not remove them. Search the knowledge base
    for "Competative" and "SIGS" to find their actual source.

  - Rate limiting: bsubears.com began returning HTTP 202 challenge responses
    after roughly 200 rapid requests. If you validate URLs in bulk, pace the
    requests. A 202 is not a 404.
-->
